521	     * The number of owners that may be created on a single business day before a bulk-signup
522	     * warning is raised. Once more than this many owners already fall on the current business
523	     * day, {@code bulkSignupWarning} is reported as {@code true} in the owner response.
524	     */
525	    private static final int BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD = 80;
526	
527	    /**
528	     * Reports whether an unusually high number of owners have been created for today's business
529	     * day, i.e. whether more than {@link #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} owners already fall on
530	     * the business day that {@code LocalDate.now()} rolls forward to.
531	     *
532	     * @return {@code true} once more than 80 owners have been created today, otherwise {@code false}
